	METHOD bJ isFactoryBuilding ()Z
		COMMENT True when this unit is a factory/production building. Unit returns false; every production building overrides it to true (LandFactory, AirFactory, SeaFactory, ExperimentalLandFactory, CommandCenter); CustomUnit returns this.meta.fu, which CustomUnitMetadataLoader sets by scanning all three tech-level special action lists for a non-ExtraAction entry with a non-null target, i.e. "this unit type can build something". Callers: Team.updateDefeatCheck and TriggerEngine.matchesObjective both use "bJ() || ak()" (factory or builder present) to mean the team still counts as alive; matchesObjective uses it with isBuilding() to match the mainBuildings objective; UnitDetectElement.isUnitCountInRange uses it for onlyMainBuildings.
