	METHOD ck hasUpgradableActions ()Z
		COMMENT True when this unit exposes at least one special action that is gated behind a credits price, i.e. the unit can be upgraded by spending credits. CustomUnit returns meta.gi, which CustomUnitMetadataLoader sets to true when any declared action has a non-null unit reference and a CustomPrice whose credits amount is > 0 (the price is parsed from the action's "price" key via CustomPrice.a). AntiNukeLauncher hard-codes false. Consumer: BattleInterface.getUnitInfoStatsText, which appends the literal "Upgradable" line to the unit info readout when this is true.
	METHOD cK isOverLiquid ()Z
	METHOD cl hasAiHighPriorityActions ()Z
		COMMENT True when at least one of this unit's special actions is flagged ai_isHighPriority, meaning the AI should consider running it. CustomUnit returns meta.fJ, which CustomUnitMetadataLoader sets to true when any action's "ai_isHighPriority" key parses to a LogicBoolean other than falseBoolean. Consumer: AI.m(float), the AI's unit update pass, which after its normal "is this unit worth microing" checks walks the unit's SpecialAction list, filters it through SpecialAction.n(Unit) and picks one at random, then issues it.
