	METHOD cn getAiUpgradePriority ()F
		COMMENT Percentage chance the AI will pick this unit's upgrade action each time it evaluates the unit, or a negative value for "use the default". CustomUnit returns meta.fK, which CustomUnitMetadataLoader computes as [ai]ai_upgradePriority * 100.0F when that key is present and not -1 (the key itself must lie in [0,1]); otherwise fK stays negative. Consumer: AI.m(float), which falls back to 6.0F when the returned value is negative and then rolls against "100 - priority" (lowered by 4 when the AI is in the warned state and overridden to 50 for resource-pool placement) to decide whether to run the upgrade.
