	METHOD cP onUnitCreated ()V
		COMMENT Post-creation hook, called once a newly built unit has been placed into the world (OrderableUnit's waypoint/path handling calls it right after setTeamOnCreate and the build-completion branch). Base implementation is empty. CustomUnit uses it to short-circuit self-building: when meta.selfBuildRate is 0 and getResourceRate() is positive, it registers the unit with its team (Team.b(unit)), forces the construction progress cm to 1.0F so it is treated as fully built, and adds it to the team's unit cache.
