		COMMENT True when this unit has any usable weapon/turret at all. CustomUnit returns [attack]canAttack. UnitType.s() (the help-sheet dump) only prints "Shoot Delay" / "Attack Range" / "Direct Damage" / "Area Damage" when var7.l() is true, and the damage block is driven by firing every turret and counting spawned projectiles. Other callers: InterfaceEngine.hasAttackCapableSelectedUnits, AI.a/as and AI.h, BattleInterface.handleDragSelection (var15.l() distinguishes combat units from builders), UnitDetectElement onlyAttack / onlyAttackAir, OrderableUnit.processAttackWaypoint and UnitType.s(). NOTE: previously mis-named canAttackUnderwaterUnits - corrected; that name belongs to ae().
